    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "Right, so it's a foundation issue. Is there any way to tell if the cracking is being caused by localized failures in the subgrade specifically, or if it's just a widespread issue with the whole stretch? I'm trying to determine if we're looking at a systemic failure or just a few bad spots where the compaction went wrong.",
